WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.499
- [Narrator] Three easy
reasons to visit Miami:

00:00:02.499 --> 00:00:06.773
the weather, the beach,
and, of course, the food.

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:10.840
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.630
Known for its Caribbean and
Latin American influences,

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.060
there are some famous dishes
that call this city home.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.160
But we are here for a few
under the radar spots,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.650
that still serve up the
classic heat Miami's known for.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:24.855
First up, a Cuban dish.

00:00:24.855 --> 00:00:27.133
But it might not be what you'd expect.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:31.013
(fast violin music)

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:31.608
to follow savory.

00:01:31.608 --> 00:01:34.525
(electronic music)

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.020
(electronic music)

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.810
- [Narrator] At one of
Miamis longest running

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.200
West Indian grocers, there's one dish

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.367
you really shouldn't miss.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.299
- [Narrator] When you find
a really good kebab spot,

00:03:32.299 --> 00:03:34.440
you shouldn't keep it to yourself.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.023
So here you go, you're welcome.

00:05:31.393 --> 00:05:34.893
(relaxing electric music)

